 "title": "Assessor | Stanton County",
 "text": "Assessor | Stanton County\nSkip to main content\nStanton County\nToggle navigation\nToggle Navigation\nStanton County\n-->\nMain menu\nAbout\nCounty Offices\nBoard\nBudgets\nCalendar\nNotices\nServices\n{ % if site_slogan %} { { site_slogan }} { % endif %}\n-->\nAssessor\nThe county assessor has the duty to value all real and personal property in the county as a basis for the county board to levy taxes. The assessor must be certified by the Department Property Assessment & Taxation in order to hold office and obtain the required continuing education hours to be recertified.\nCounty Assessor\nLeslie Hasenkamp\n804 Ivy St\nPO Box 895\nStanton NE 68779\n(402)439-2210\nFax:(402)439-2262\nEmail: assessor@stantoncountyne.gov\nServices:\nReal Estate Assessments\nHomestead Exemptions\nProperty Assessment Records\nTax Exemptions on Real & Personal Property for Educational, Religious, Charitable and Cemetery Organizations\nLinks:\nStanton County GIS Data website: Beacon-Stanton County NE\nNebraska Department Revenue: www.revenue.nebraska.gov\nProperty Assessment Division: www.revenue.nebraska.gov/pad\nAssessment Calendar, Information Guides, etc\nCertificates of Value\n♦ 2026 - all political subdivisions\nCounty, City, Village, SID#1, Ag Society\nFire Districts\nSchool Districts, School Bonds\nESU, P2T Jnt Publ Agcy, NRD, NECC\nCertification Notices to: Antelope,Colfax,Cuming,Dodge,Madison,Platte,Wayne\n♦ 2025 - all political subdivisions\nCounty, City, Village, SID#1, Ag Society\nFire Districts\nSchool Districts , School Bonds\nESU, P2T Jnt Publ Agcy , LENRD , NECC\nCertification Notices to: Antelope,Colfax,Cuming,Dodge,Madison,Platte,Wayne\n♦ 2024 - all political subdivisons\nCounty, City, Village, SID#1, Ag Society\nFire Districts\nSchool Districts, School Bonds\nESU, P2T Jnt Publ Agcy, NRD, Comm College\n♦ 2023\nCounty, City, Village, SID#1\nFire Districts\nSchool Districts, School Bonds\nAg Society, NRD, Comm College, ESU, P2T Jnt Publ Agcy\n♦ 2022\n♦ 2021\n♦ 2020\nLevy Information\nLevy 2026 - 2027\nLevy 2025 - 2026 - set Oct 10, 2025\nLevy 2024 - 2025\nLevy 2023 - 2024\nLevy 2022 - 2023\nLevy 2021 - 2022\nLevy 2020 - 2021\nInformation\n804 Ivy St\nPO Box 347\nStanton, NE 68779\n(402) 439-2222\nContact Us\nUseful Links\nOnline Services\nSheriff’s Office\nCounty Attorney\nCounty Treasurer\nCounty Clerk\nCalendar\nPublic Records\nElection Results\n© State of Nebraska\nPowered by Tyler Technologies\nNebraska.gov | Policies | Login",
